# Copy to .env.local to try the site against another API. Not needed for local development:
# `just web-dev` proxies /api to `just api-dev` on 127.0.0.1:8080.
#
# The production build reads this at build time. It must be an absolute origin, because the
# Content-Security-Policy allows the page to call only the site itself and this one origin.
# Without it the built site shows the saved copy and does not call any API.
# VITE_API_URL=https://example.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws
